  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Mapper additions aligning the bundle with the DDS output:\n\t\t  - Bundle: assembles the four List resources (Problems, Active Allergies, Medication List and Miscellaneous record) from the resources already mapped.\n\t\t  - Medication: the MedicationRequest and MedicationStatement mappers emit a separate Medication resource and reference it through medicationReference, instead of an inline medication code.\n\t\t  - Meta: AllergyIntolerance, Condition, Encounter, FamilyMemberHistory, Immunization, MedicationStatement, Observation and ReferralRequest carry the record-owner organisation ODS code as a meta tag.\n\t\t  - Identifiers: the business key identifier uses its own BusinessKeyIdentifierSystem setting, defaulting to https://fhir.hl7.org.uk/Id/dds, instead of the organisation identifier system.\n\t\t  - Immunization: emits the CareConnect DateRecorded extension.\n\t\t  Breaking change carried from 0.2.0.2: properties that the source data never populates were removed from the OLIDS models.\n\t\t  - Location: PatientId, TypeCode, HouseName, HouseNumber, Street, CloseDate, RecordOwnerOrganisationCode, Year and PatientShardKey.\n\t\t  - AllergyIntolerance: ClinicalStatus, VerificationStatus, Category, DatePrecisionConceptId, MultiLexAction, LdsId, LdsDatasetId, LdsCdmEventId, LdsVersionerEventId and PatientShardKey.",
